msgid "- They give their consent to the processing of personal data by the Association, pursuant to art. 13 of Italian Legislative Decree no. 196/2003 and to GDPR 679/2016, for the pursuit of the Association's institutional purposes and to the extent necessary to fulfil the tax, legal and insurance obligations laid down by law."
