#: Home/Resources/privacy.htm:6
msgid "- They give their consent to the use of personal data by the Association, pursuant to art. 13 of Italian Legislative Decree no. 196/2003 and to GDPR 679/2016, for profiling and direct communication initiatives - by e-mail, text message or ordinary mail - for the pursuit of the Association's institutional purposes."
